      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-10-03_WidnesExaminer_art0013" n="art0013">
        <head>GOOD NEWS FOR LADIES.</head>
        <p>GOOD NEWS FOR LADIES.</p>
        <p>ALADY, the daugh r of a late eminent physician, will be pleased to forward full particulars (on receipt of a stamped directed envelope) of a Certain Cure for all forms cf Irregularities, no matter how caueed or how long standing The Remedy causes no Pain, Nausea, or Prostration what ever.</p>
