        <p>their action. INSTANT RELIEF AND RAPIDLY CURB TRH WORST FORM OF GOUT, RHEUMATISM, RHEUMATIC GOUT, PAINS IN THE HEAD, FACE, AND LIMBS. And have the largest recommendation ever given any Patent Medicine of its class. GOUT " 16,8 u r ton -crescent Dewsbury. road. Leeds, May 2nd, 1894. SiMB U M ATI Std "Dear Si r, —lt is with unbounded pleasure I send you a few lines in GOUT praise of your most excellent Pills. It is six years since I first had RHEUMATIS.M Rheumatic Gout, and I had three nuastbs in bed with it. Of course GOUT I had the doctor, and he sweated me down almost to a skeleton, HBUMAT IS Tath,e.oik,exatrusipwriansg pl,r.,htaddeadnotyhear GOUT friend to try your Pills. I did so, and am quite sure they prevented RHEUMATISM my being laid up again. Ever since, when I have had the least GOUT pain I have taken 2 or 3 Pills and I have been all right again ItHICUMATISII directly. I WOULD NOT BE WITHOUT • GOUT THEM IF THEY COST ONE POUND A BOTTLE. HBUMA TI S M You are quite at liberty to make what use you like of this, and I GOUT shall be pleased to answer any poor sufferer who cares to write RHBU MA TISM nre (enclosing stamped address). .Wishing you every success, Yours truly, ALBERT MOUNTAIN." BADE'S GOUT AND RHEUMATIC PILLS Are sold by all Chemists, in Bottles. Is. ljai. and 2s. 93, or sena post free for Postal Order by the Proprietor, GEORGE BADE, 72, GOSIVELL-ROAD, 11.0. Ask for and be sure you obtain EA.DE'S GOUT AND 11110 IT MATH) PILLS, EADE'S PILLS.</p>
