      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-10-03_WidnesExaminer_art0014" n="art0014">
        <head>To LADIES.</head>
        <p>To LADIES.</p>
        <p>MACKENZIE'S FEMALE MEDICINE Will positively remove the most obstinate Obstructions, Irregularities, Sc., from any cause in twelve hours, Guaran- teed the most powerful and strongest upon eirth. Failure is impossible. It acts like magic in the most long standing and intricate obstructions. Ladies will save time, trouble. and expense by Coming to an experienced Speca.list at first. Post free under cover, securely packed, with full directions and advice (4e. 6d.) FOUR SHILLINGS AN' SIXPENCE, WITH WRITTEN GUARANTEE OF CURB Mrs. L., of High-st.. Morley, near Leeds, wites t,—" One 4s. 6d. pacitet cured me atter FOUR MON't HS' anxiety of mind, and alter Ibad tried no less thsn AN, different so- called remedies. My sister recommended me to you, and she is. equally enthusiastic. Several Ltdies h' ye told me they have always been cured by you when othec t ms failed." Send at once for 100 paged Book of eartic,ilars and Testi- monials. which are sworn on oath bett/re. Her Majesty's Com- missioner tor oaths to be true and genuine. All open to in- spection and £l,OOO given to any charity if one is proved not genuine. Advice willingly free. mrs. B. MACKENZIE, Trafford House, 83, Dawes-rood,</p>
        <p>, Fulham, London. SM. „avoid Imitations.—Worthleas and injurious. Please men- yen this paper. -</p>
